        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DG525, 5 Inch Hotel Security Door Guard</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hotel Door Flip Style 5\" Security Door Guard is easy to install and operate. Security Door Guards are used on many hotel doors but work great for your home. It is packaged with matching finish screws and protector plate, and is available in 8 great finishes. Manufactured by Deltana, an architectural hardware leader with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of solid brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DG525.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"5 Inch Security Door Guard Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOther Secutiry Door Guards we have available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-security-door-guard-deltana-dg425\"><b>4 Inch Door Guard</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/door-security-chain-with-doorbolt-deltana-cdg35\"><b>Chain Door Guard</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-security-door-guard-with-ball-tension-action-deltana-dgsb675\"><b>Contemporary Door Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification</b> of the Deltana DG525 Hotel Security Door Guard:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Guard Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Guard Plate Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Protector Plate:  1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting screws</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DG525.pdf?v=1704262176\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DG525 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 5 inch Security Door Guard, Deltana DG525",
                "description": "Deltana DG525 5 Inch Security Door Guard - The Hotel Door Flip Style 5 Inch Security Door Guard is easy to install and operate. Security Door Guards are used on many hotel doors but work great for your home. It is packaged with matching finish screws and available in 8 great finishes. Manufacture by Deltana an architectural hardware leader with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of solid brass door hardware.\r\n",
